5 - Files
    -----

    A002_00_Premises.v

      A001 import boundary and arithmetic substrate. Defines canonical pairing
      guards, tagged lists, formula constructors, and the result protocol.

    A002_01__Hilbert_Syntax_Checkers.v

      Arithmetic parsers and local K, S, and MP checkers. MP requires two
      strictly earlier citations and checks their formulas syntactically.

    A002_02__Normalization.v

      Defines normalized formulas, rules, lines, derivations, Boolean checkers,
      and the independent judgments `NormalizedStep`, `NormalizedLines`, and
      `NormalizedProof`. Proves reflection, arithmetic soundness, canonical
      quotation completeness, and independent certificate replay.

    A002_94_IO.v

      Extraction-facing dispatcher for verification, certificate replay,
      parsing, and diagnostics. Provides compact `BinNums.Z` result views.

    A002_95_API.v

      Stable package API. Re-exports the certified theorem and executable
      surfaces.

    A002_97_Artifacts.v

      Redirects `Print Assumptions` for the published theorems and extracts the
      arithmetic verifier, normalized checker, and IO dispatcher to OCaml.

    A002_98_Sanity.v

      Closed computations for a K instance and a three-line K/K/MP derivation.

    _appendix/_artifacts/

      Extracted OCaml: `A002_Verifier.{ml,mli}` and `A002_IO.{ml,mli}`.

    _appendix/_assumptions/

      Redirected `Print Assumptions` output for the public theorem surface.


6 - API
    ---

    The public theorem surface is exposed by

      `From A002 Require Import A002_95_API.`

    Public surface by use case:

    Normalized syntax and validity:

      NormalizedFormula       : Type                                        (02)
      NFVar                   : nat -> NormalizedFormula                    (02)
      NFImp                   : NormalizedFormula -> NormalizedFormula ->
                                NormalizedFormula                           (02)
      NormalizedRule          : Type                                        (02)
      NRAxK, NRAxS            : NormalizedRule                              (02)
      NRMP                    : nat -> nat -> NormalizedRule                (02)
      NormalizedLine          : Type                                        (02)
      NormalizedDerivation    : Type                                        (02)
      NormalizedStep          : list NormalizedFormula -> NormalizedRule ->
                                NormalizedFormula -> Prop                   (02)
      NormalizedLines         : list NormalizedFormula ->
                                NormalizedDerivation -> Prop                (02)
      NormalizedProof         : NormalizedDerivation ->
                                NormalizedFormula -> Prop                   (02)

    Executable checking:

      normalized_formula_eqb  : NormalizedFormula ->
                                NormalizedFormula -> bool                   (02)
      normalized_stepb        : list NormalizedFormula -> NormalizedRule ->
                                NormalizedFormula -> bool                   (02)
      normalized_linesb       : list NormalizedFormula ->
                                NormalizedDerivation -> bool                (02)
      normalized_verifyb      : NormalizedDerivation ->
                                NormalizedFormula -> bool                   (02)
      normalized_failure_index : list NormalizedFormula ->
                                 NormalizedDerivation -> nat -> option nat  (02)

    Arithmetic boundary:

      A002_Verify_certified   : nat -> nat -> nat                           (02)
      A002_Certified_Certb    : nat -> nat -> nat -> bool                   (02)
      normalize_formula      : nat -> option NormalizedFormula              (02)
      normalize_derivation   : nat -> option NormalizedDerivation           (02)
      encode_normalized_formula : NormalizedFormula -> nat                  (02)
      encode_normalized_derivation : NormalizedDerivation -> nat            (02)
      certified_payload      : nat -> nat -> nat                            (02)
      canonical001b          : nat -> bool                                  (00)

    Dispatcher and inspection:

      A002_IO_Query, A002_IO_Result                                         (94)
      A002_IO          : A002_IO_Query -> A002_IO_Result                    (94)
      A002_IO_Z        : A002_IO_Query -> A002_IO_Result_Z                  (94)

    Certified theorems:

      normalized_verifyb_iff : forall lines target,
        normalized_verifyb lines target = true <->
        NormalizedProof lines target

      certified_verify_accept_sound : forall d theta payload,
        A002_Verify_certified d theta = accept payload ->
        exists lines target,
          normalize_derivation d = Some lines /\
          normalize_formula theta = Some target /\
          NormalizedProof lines target

      certified_verify_complete : forall lines target,
        NormalizedProof lines target ->
        A002_Verify_certified
          (encode_normalized_derivation lines)
          (encode_normalized_formula target) =
        accept
          (certified_payload
            (encode_normalized_derivation lines)
            (encode_normalized_formula target))

7 - Notes
    -----

    The normalized layer is the preferred checking surface: formulas and lists
    carry their structure directly and avoid the rapid growth of nested A001
    codes. The arithmetic layer remains the serialization boundary for clients
    that require natural-number protocols.

    Accepted certified results bind the derivation code to the target code.
    `A002_Certified_Certb` independently checks that binding, reruns
    normalization, and applies the proved structural verifier.
